#: waptserver/templates/index.html:7
msgid "PADIT server"
msgstr "Serveur PADIT"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:11
msgid ""
"The PADIT server is administered from the PADIT console installed on a "
"Windows workstation."
msgstr ""
"L'administration du serveur PADIT s'effectue depuis la console PADIT "
"installée sur un poste Windows."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:12
msgid ""
"To install the administration console, download PADIT Setup and run the "
"installer on the workstation from which you want to administer the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Pour installer la console d'administration, téléchargez PADIT Setup puis "
"lancez l'installation sur le poste depuis lequel vous souhaitez "
"administrer le serveur."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:13
msgid "Download PADIT Setup"
msgstr "Télécharger PADIT Setup"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:19
msgid "PADIT publisher certificate"
msgstr "Certificat de l'éditeur PADIT"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:21
msgid ""
"The PADIT executables in this distribution are digitally signed by Thouet "
"Software."
msgstr ""
"Les exécutables PADIT de cette distribution sont signés numériquement par "
"Thouet Software."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:22
msgid ""
"During installation, PADIT Setup asks for confirmation before adding the "
"Thouet Software Signing Root CA to the Local Machine Trusted Root "
"Certification Authorities store."
msgstr ""
"Lors de l'installation, PADIT Setup demande confirmation avant d'ajouter "
"l'autorité de certification Thouet Software Signing Root CA au magasin "
"Autorités de certification racines de confiance de l'ordinateur Windows."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:26
msgid "Download Thouet Software Signing Root CA"
msgstr "Télécharger le certificat racine Thouet Software"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:30
msgid "SHA256:"
msgstr "SHA256 :"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:34
msgid ""
"The public certificate is also available here for verification or manual "
"deployment. Installing it means that you choose to trust Thouet Software "
"as the publisher of this PADIT distribution."
msgstr ""
"Le certificat public est également disponible ici pour vérification ou "
"déploiement manuel. Son installation signifie que vous choisissez de "
"faire confiance à Thouet Software comme éditeur de cette distribution "
"PADIT."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:39
msgid "Installing the PADIT agent"
msgstr "Installation de l'agent PADIT"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:41
msgid ""
"To manually add a workstation to this PADIT server, download and run the "
"PADIT agent on the Windows workstation."
msgstr ""
"Pour ajouter manuellement un poste à ce serveur PADIT, téléchargez et "
"exécutez l'agent PADIT sur le poste Windows concerné."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:42
msgid ""
"The agent published by this server is already configured with the "
"settings required to connect to it. Once installation is complete and the"
" workstation is registered, it will appear in the PADIT console."
msgstr ""
"L'agent publié par ce serveur est déjà configuré avec les paramètres "
"nécessaires pour s'y connecter. Une fois l'installation terminée et le "
"poste enregistré, celui-ci apparaîtra dans la console PADIT."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:43
msgid "Download the PADIT agent"
msgstr "Télécharger l'agent PADIT"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:47
msgid "Deploying the PADIT agent by GPO"
msgstr "Déploiement de l'agent PADIT par GPO"

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:49
msgid ""
"PADIT Deploy can automatically deploy the PADIT agent to Windows "
"workstations using a Group Policy Object (GPO)."
msgstr ""
"PADIT Deploy permet de déployer automatiquement l'agent PADIT sur les postes"
" Windows à l'aide d'une stratégie de groupe (GPO)."

#: waptserver/templates/index.html:50
msgid ""
"The command below uses the version and SHA256 fingerprint of the agent "
"currently published by this server:"
msgstr ""
"La commande ci-dessous utilise la version et l'empreinte SHA256 de "
"l'agent actuellement publié par ce serveur :"

